WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.290
Dave: Introducing...

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:08.930
three time golden bib award champion.

00:00:08.930 --> 00:00:12.660
Winner of the Hammy for Best Original Custard.

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:15.590
The Stuffed Face Magazine Man of the Year!

00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:18.360
He was also Employee of the Month once at
a Denny's in 2006.

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:24.420
It's my honor to present to you...

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:27.850
CHEF BRIAN!!!

00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:29.570
*cheering*

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:32.390
Brian: Hello friends.

00:00:32.390 --> 00:00:35.590
And welcome to another fun filled episode
of The Wokking Dead.

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:38.120
I'm your new host, Brian.

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:39.280
Would you look at that.

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:44.469
I guess it's THYME to get cooking!

00:00:44.469 --> 00:00:46.550
*rimshot*

00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:49.530
Today's recipe comes from a user named CGruesCook.

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:52.809
He says, "we're gonna make some delicious
Bloody Sundaes!"

00:00:52.809 --> 00:00:54.050
Cordon: RAUGH!

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:56.319
Darn right we are!

00:00:56.319 --> 00:00:59.899
Dave: Who let Cordon on set?

00:00:59.899 --> 00:01:00.899
Security?

00:01:00.899 --> 00:01:01.899
Security?!

00:01:01.899 --> 00:01:02.899
Cordon: They're not here Dave.

00:01:02.899 --> 00:01:04.760
I gave them tickets to Dead Air on Ice!

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:06.670
Dave: We're not doing the show with you Cordon.

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:07.670
Get out!

00:01:07.670 --> 00:01:09.150
Cordon: I'm not going anywhere.

00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:11.410
Brian: I think it'd be fun to have a guest
host on the show.

00:01:11.410 --> 00:01:13.360
Dave: He just tried to kill you!

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:15.220
Brian: I'm sure it was all in good fun.

00:01:15.220 --> 00:01:16.220
Cordon: Yeah Dave!

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:17.830
Quit being a party pooper.

00:01:17.830 --> 00:01:21.290
Dave: I'm just... know what?

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:22.290
This is unbelievable.

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:23.290
Cordon: Haha!

00:01:23.290 --> 00:01:35.640
Cordon and Brian: WE ARE THE WOKKING DEAD!!!!

00:01:35.640 --> 00:01:43.630
Brian: For this super COOL recipe, you're
gonna need the following items.

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:49.500
Ice cream, whipped cream, cherries, chocolate
and strawberry syrup and a banana.

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:51.550
Cordon: And... human blood!

00:01:51.550 --> 00:01:52.550
*laugh track*

00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:54.050
Cordon: What the fudge was that?

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:55.710
Brian: Very funny Cordon.

00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:57.440
But we're gonna use this to chop up the banana.

00:01:57.440 --> 00:01:58.440
Cordon: No!

00:01:58.440 --> 00:01:59.440
NO!

00:01:59.440 --> 00:02:01.060
You're doing it all wrong.

00:02:01.060 --> 00:02:02.470
You have to do it like this!

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:03.920
Brian: Whoa!

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:06.100
Hold on Cordon.

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:07.550
Cordon: What?!

00:02:07.550 --> 00:02:08.970
Brian: This is my show.

00:02:08.970 --> 00:02:10.739
I think we ought to do it my way.

00:02:10.739 --> 00:02:14.080
Cordon: What do you mean YOUR show?

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:17.520
It's called "The Wokking Dead" for Buddha's
sake.

00:02:17.520 --> 00:02:19.390
Brian: I'll tell you what.

00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:23.020
Since you're a guest on my show, we can each
make one.

00:02:23.020 --> 00:02:26.450
You do yours your way, and I'll do mine my
way.

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:27.450
Cordon: UGH!

00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:28.450
Fine.

00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:29.450
Whatever.

00:02:29.450 --> 00:02:32.510
But what do you say we make this a bit more
interesting?

00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:37.000
We'll find a random person to judge our desserts.

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:41.540
And if I win, I get to stay on the show as
a co-host.

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:42.540
Brian: OK.

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:43.540
Cordon: Gimme that!

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:50.550
Brian: But if I win, you're off the show and
you sacrifice all your recipes to me to be

00:02:50.550 --> 00:02:52.810
put in my new cookbook: Brian's Cookbook.

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:53.810
Cordon: Wait.

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:57.390
It's called Brian's Cookbook?

00:02:57.390 --> 00:02:59.050
No bad pun?

00:02:59.050 --> 00:03:01.630
No tagline?

00:03:01.630 --> 00:03:02.920
Fine!

00:03:02.920 --> 00:03:04.209
Whatever!

00:03:04.209 --> 00:03:10.160
You've got yourself a deal, Chef Brian.

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:15.060
Brian: OK gang.

00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:20.380
The first step for my sundae, as always, is
to wash your hands to get rid of those yucky

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:21.380
germs.

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:22.380
Cordon: Screw that!

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:25.140
I haven't washed my hands in years!

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:30.140
Brian: Now, just flatten out the top of your
ice cream.

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:35.820
Cordon: I like to scoop my ice cream into
a big eyeball like this.

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:41.000
Incidentally, this is a great tool for scooping
out someone's actual eyeball.

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:44.300
Brian: Next up, we're gonna add our two banana
slices.

00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:47.560
This should add some aPEEL to your sundae.

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:52.160
Cordon: You should make like a banana and...
kill yourself Brian.

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:53.160
*rimshot*

00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:59.060
Cordon: A real chef would dip their banana
slices in the chocolate like this, and place

00:03:59.060 --> 00:04:00.060
it right here.

00:04:00.060 --> 00:04:05.459
Then you can stab it in the eye with a toothpick.

00:04:05.459 --> 00:04:10.950
Incidentally, toothpicks are great tools for
stabbing someone in the actual eye.

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:16.000
Brian: Now it's time to WHIP up some features.

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:20.769
Cordon: I like to whip my cream myself.

00:04:20.769 --> 00:04:26.590
Incidentally, this is also a great tool for
torturing someone.

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:28.050
Where's Dave anyway?

00:04:28.050 --> 00:04:31.400
Brian: I'm just gonna grab this--

00:04:31.400 --> 00:04:32.400
bottle of--

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:35.920
Cordon: Your move Brian...

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:40.510
Brian: Let me just-- OW!

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:41.760
Shhhhhellfish.

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:44.300
That really hurt Cordon.

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:47.750
Cordon: Not as bad as it's gonna hurt when
you lose Brian!

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:51.230
I hope you've all placed your whips carefully.

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:56.620
Now, run the syrup down the ridges.

00:04:56.620 --> 00:05:00.940
Gimme that!

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:05.270
Cordon: Perfect!

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:09.229
Brian: Now just cut a cherry in half.

00:05:09.229 --> 00:05:12.720
Cordon: Gimme those.

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:21.870
Cordon: Now I like to add pure vanilla extract.

00:05:21.870 --> 00:05:23.970
Even though it's vanilla ice cream already.

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:29.310
It's just so good.

00:05:29.310 --> 00:05:37.030
Brian: I'm gonna add a bit of blood to finish
off my Bloody Sundae.

00:05:37.030 --> 00:05:39.780
Cordon: No, you're doing it all wrong!

00:05:39.780 --> 00:05:40.780
Gimme that.

00:05:40.780 --> 00:05:42.910
You have to do it like this.

00:05:42.910 --> 00:05:44.110
AHHHH!!!

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:45.310
Done!

00:05:45.310 --> 00:05:47.710
Brian: Alrighty.

00:05:47.710 --> 00:05:48.710
Wasn't that fun?

00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:53.000
Cordon: I really realized over the course
of this episode, I hate you.

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:54.510
Brian: O... K...

00:05:54.510 --> 00:05:58.470
I'm afraid that's all we have time for one
this episode, but tune in next time to see

00:05:58.470 --> 00:05:59.470
who the winner is.

00:05:59.470 --> 00:06:00.810
Cordon: And don't forget to vote!

00:06:00.810 --> 00:06:03.120
Brian: Where would they do that?

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:06.490
Cordon: In the comments of course!!

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:08.280
And it's gonna be me you vote for.

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:11.630
Brian: As always, try these recipes in your
own kitchen.

00:06:11.630 --> 00:06:12.740
Cordon: IN YOUR OWN HOME!

00:06:12.740 --> 00:06:17.820
Brian and Cordon: Thanks for watching and
we'll see you next time!

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:29.540
Dave: I can't take this anymore.

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:35.290
Cordon has pissed me off for the last time.

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:38.009
I have to call in reinforcements.

00:06:38.009 --> 00:06:39.580
Man on Phone: Reinforcements?

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:41.360
Dave: I have to call...

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:42.919
The FDA.

